TY  - CPAPER
TI  - Sample-Efficient Evaluation of Human-AI Teams
AB  - Evaluating a human-AI team is expensive because every data point needs a person. We propose an adaptive design that chooses which items to show next, and prove that it estimates team accuracy within $\epsilon$ using $O(\log(1/\delta)/\epsilon^2)$ items. On two crowdsourced tasks it matches the full evaluation with 38% of the annotations.
