TY  - CPAPER
TI  - Explanations That Help: A Benchmark for Appropriate Reliance
AB  - Explanations are meant to help people decide when to follow an AI's advice. We release a benchmark of 14 decision tasks with ground truth, human baselines and a protocol for measuring appropriate reliance, and evaluate nine explanation methods. None improves appropriate reliance over showing the model's confidence alone.
